#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0529 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0529 (Condition: ARM ^= null; Rule: RFENDTC ^= null). Row 1: ARM = Placebo with RFENDTC 2024-06-10 -> silent. Row 2: ARM = Drug A with RFENDTC empty -> fires. Row 3: screen failure, ARM empty and RFENDTC empty -> condition not met, silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 USUBJID=S1-002 ARM="Drug A" RFENDTC=
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID   type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col RFSTDTC  type=Char label="Subject Reference Start Date/Time"
col RFENDTC  type=Char label="Subject Reference End Date/Time"
col ARMCD    type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM      type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
col ARMNRS   type=Char label="Reason Arm and/or Actual Arm is Null"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001 | 001 | 2024-01-10 | 2024-06-10 | PBO  | Placebo | PBO  | Placebo |
S1 | DM | S1-002 | 002 | 2024-01-12 |            | DRGA | Drug A  | DRGA | Drug A  |
S1 | DM | S1-003 | 003 |            |            |      |         |      |         | SCREEN FAILURE
